        "data_preprocessing_details": "Series divided into windows of size 7 days; each window labeled anomalous if it contains one of the five anomalous days; training uses only non-anomalous windows; train/validation/test split of non-anomalous data 0.7/0.3, then remaining samples split 0.3/0.7 for validation/test.",
        "evaluation_methodology": "Each experiment repeated 30 times; hyperparameters selected by maximizing balanced accuracy on validation set; final evaluation on test set using Precision, Recall, F1-score, and Balanced Accuracy."
